1
00:00:13,263 --> 00:00:15,432
<i>Akane, itzuli naiz.</i>

2
00:00:16,099 --> 00:00:18,309
Horixe esan nahi nuke...

3
00:00:19,936 --> 00:00:22,647
baina berehala joan behar dut.

4
00:00:24,024 --> 00:00:26,609
Ez galdetu. Ezin dizut zergatia esan.

5
00:00:27,193 --> 00:00:30,280
Baina gauza bat esan diezazuket.

6
00:00:31,781 --> 00:00:35,410
Elkar ikusten dugun hurrengoan
gizon osoa izango naiz.

7
00:00:36,077 --> 00:00:37,369
Beraz, mesedez,

8
00:00:37,370 --> 00:00:41,332
irtengo...

9
00:00:44,127 --> 00:00:46,336
Ezin dut! Lotsa ematen dit esatea:

10
00:00:46,337 --> 00:00:49,006
"Irtengo zara nirekin?".

11
00:00:49,007 --> 00:00:52,843
Geldi! Perbertitua!

12
00:00:52,844 --> 00:00:55,096
A zer banketea izan duten nire begiek!

13
00:00:55,597 --> 00:00:56,973
Harrapa ezazue!

14
00:01:04,064 --> 00:01:07,399
Kaka. Zaharra izateko, oso arina da.

15
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:09,985
Egunero etortzen da institutura.

16
00:01:09,986 --> 00:01:12,988
Amaitu da jazartzen gaituenean
bere atzetik segika hastea.

17
00:01:12,989 --> 00:01:14,823
Baduzu planen bat, Akane?

18
00:01:14,824 --> 00:01:15,825
Bai.

19
00:01:16,493 --> 00:01:17,701
Hauxe egingo dugu.

20
00:01:17,702 --> 00:01:20,621
Bihar Soinketa daukagu, ez?

21
00:01:20,622 --> 00:01:21,664
Ba...

22
00:01:23,208 --> 00:01:26,919
Ryôga, zer ari zara hor lurrean?

23
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:27,921
Kaixo.

24
00:02:59,053 --> 00:03:02,014
Orduan, bidaian zoaz berriro, Ryôga?

25
00:03:02,015 --> 00:03:03,515
{\an8}PUTZU EZKUTUAREN BILA

26
00:03:03,516 --> 00:03:06,561
{\an8}Bai. Ez dakit
berriz noiz ikusiko zaitudan.

27
00:03:07,061 --> 00:03:10,355
Ez zara Ranma ikustera joango?
Denbora asko pasa da.

28
00:03:10,356 --> 00:03:13,401
- Ez dut bere aurpegia ikusi nahi.
- A, bale.

29
00:03:15,570 --> 00:03:19,157
Baina lagun onak zarete, ez?

30
00:03:19,741 --> 00:03:22,827
Esan ohi den bezala,
borroka egiten dutenek...

31
00:03:24,204 --> 00:03:25,705
Halere, Akane...

32
00:03:34,297 --> 00:03:36,841
- Zera...
- Bai?

33
00:03:37,425 --> 00:03:39,802
Itzultzen naizenean, mesedez...

34
00:03:40,595 --> 00:03:41,887
Zer?

35
00:03:41,888 --> 00:03:44,890
Aterako...

36
00:03:44,891 --> 00:03:46,809
Hartuko duzu hau?

37
00:03:48,311 --> 00:03:52,273
Milesker beti oroigarriak ekartzeagatik.
Zein jatorra zaren.

38
00:03:54,859 --> 00:03:57,862
Bueno, zaindu. Agur!

39
00:04:00,406 --> 00:04:02,783
Kaka zaharra!

40
00:04:02,784 --> 00:04:03,993
Ryôga.

41
00:04:04,994 --> 00:04:07,956
- Akane?
- Musutxo bat eman nahi nizun.

42
00:04:10,291 --> 00:04:12,085
Baina, Akane,

43
00:04:12,627 --> 00:04:16,421
oraindik ez dugu ezta eskutik heldu ere.

44
00:04:16,422 --> 00:04:19,466
Ez nago horretarako prest.

45
00:04:19,467 --> 00:04:20,969
Bueno, ba ahaztu.

46
00:04:25,181 --> 00:04:27,015
A zer mutil biolentoa.

47
00:04:27,016 --> 00:04:29,393
Aspaldi ez genuela elkar ikusten, e?

48
00:04:29,394 --> 00:04:33,064
Ixo. Nola ausartzen zara
gazte baten bihotzarekin jolastera.

49
00:04:33,648 --> 00:04:35,775
Zergatik zaude hain haserre, P-Chan?

50
00:04:39,988 --> 00:04:42,114
Lastima, Ranma.

51
00:04:42,115 --> 00:04:45,076
Laster P-Chani agur esango diozu.

52
00:04:47,036 --> 00:04:49,622
Hona hemen zergatia!

53
00:04:50,248 --> 00:04:51,749
Zer mapa mota da hau?

54
00:04:52,458 --> 00:04:53,835
Altxor baten mapa?

55
00:04:54,335 --> 00:04:56,129
Kaikua! Itzuli hori!

56
00:04:57,046 --> 00:04:58,548
Arraioa.

57
00:05:03,803 --> 00:05:04,929
Kaka, ez.

58
00:05:06,472 --> 00:05:10,059
Japoniako gizon itoaren putzua!

59
00:05:16,983 --> 00:05:18,860
Japoniako gizon itoaren putzua?

60
00:05:22,280 --> 00:05:25,073
<i>Aspaldi-aspaldian, Musashi probintzian,</i>

61
00:05:25,074 --> 00:05:29,162
<i>azeriak jendea gogaitzen ari ziren
beren gaiztakeriekin.</i>

62
00:05:29,746 --> 00:05:33,540
<i>Egun batean, Txinatik zetorren monje batek</i>

63
00:05:33,541 --> 00:05:38,004
<i>bere makulua lurrean sartu zuen
eta putzu bat sortu zen bertan.</i>

64
00:05:39,255 --> 00:05:42,174
<i>Putzu hartan bainatu ziren azeriak</i>

65
00:05:42,175 --> 00:05:46,846
<i>gizon bihurtu ziren.</i>

66
00:05:48,056 --> 00:05:52,893
<i>Eta horrelaxe,
azeri gaizto guztiak desagertu egin ziren.</i>

67
00:05:52,894 --> 00:05:56,105
<i>Baina jendeak
buruko min handiagoarekin amaitu zuen.</i>

68
00:05:57,940 --> 00:06:02,153
Gizon itoaren putzua da, bai.

69
00:06:03,363 --> 00:06:07,450
<i>Putzuan bainatuz gero,
madarikazioaz libratuko naiz.</i>

70
00:06:08,034 --> 00:06:09,869
<i>Gizon itxura izango dut beti.</i>

71
00:06:12,622 --> 00:06:14,040
Eta horrexegatik...

72
00:06:14,874 --> 00:06:16,250
bertara joango naiz.

73
00:06:17,877 --> 00:06:20,171
Zaude unetxo bat, Ryôga.

74
00:06:20,922 --> 00:06:23,298
Lankidetza? Bai, kaka!

75
00:06:23,299 --> 00:06:26,009
Eramango zaitudala esan dut.

76
00:06:26,010 --> 00:06:28,178
Ez dut zure laguntzarik behar.

77
00:06:28,179 --> 00:06:30,389
Badaukat mapa bat.

78
00:06:30,390 --> 00:06:33,059
Beti galtzen zara.
Txerriari konfiturak ematea da.

79
00:06:34,310 --> 00:06:39,565
Tristura ematen dit pentsatzeak
laster ez didatela "txerri" deituko.

80
00:06:43,403 --> 00:06:46,614
E, kale horrek ez du irteerarik.

81
00:06:48,366 --> 00:06:51,368
Ibiltzen jarraituz gero,
azkenean iritsiko naiz.

82
00:06:51,369 --> 00:06:54,497
Japoniako gizon itoaren putzua zain dut.

83
00:06:55,832 --> 00:06:58,126
Tira, utzi ikusten.

84
00:06:59,335 --> 00:07:01,670
Madarikazioaz libratuko den bakarra naiz.

85
00:07:01,671 --> 00:07:02,964
Hemendik da.

86
00:07:03,464 --> 00:07:06,092
Ergel hori
alderantzizko norabidean zihoan.

87
00:07:06,759 --> 00:07:08,845
Kabroia! Itzuli mapa!

88
00:07:10,346 --> 00:07:12,722
Altxatu. Agurtu.

89
00:07:12,723 --> 00:07:15,058
Azkenean, Soinketa daukagu orain.

90
00:07:15,059 --> 00:07:17,978
Agure perbertitu horrek
berriro jazarriko gaitu.

91
00:07:17,979 --> 00:07:19,021
Hau nazka.

92
00:07:20,565 --> 00:07:23,733
Lasai, oraingoan ezingo du.

93
00:07:23,734 --> 00:07:26,319
Akane, zerbait egin duzu ala?

94
00:07:26,320 --> 00:07:27,613
Bueno...

95
00:07:33,369 --> 00:07:38,582
Ranma, hemen al da?
Institutuko atzeko lorategia da, ez?

96
00:07:38,583 --> 00:07:39,959
Hemen da, dudarik gabe.

97
00:07:40,585 --> 00:07:44,754
Maparen arabera,
estatua hau pista garrantzitsua da.

98
00:07:44,755 --> 00:07:47,341
Milesker bidea erakusteagatik.

99
00:07:49,051 --> 00:07:52,429
Ehun pauso
azeriak seinalatzen duen norabidean.

100
00:07:52,430 --> 00:07:55,141
Hortxe egongo da gizon itoaren putzua!

101
00:07:57,018 --> 00:07:58,603
Artaburua, itxaron niri!

102
00:07:59,562 --> 00:08:00,897
Ez jarraitu!

103
00:08:01,564 --> 00:08:03,106
Koldar halakoa!

104
00:08:03,107 --> 00:08:05,276
Horrela lortu nahi duzu abantaila?

105
00:08:05,860 --> 00:08:08,029
Ixo! Zu zara akoplatu dena!

106
00:08:08,696 --> 00:08:10,614
Nik gidatu zaitut honaino!

107
00:08:10,615 --> 00:08:14,576
Laurogeita lau, 85, 86.
Eraikin horren azpian egongo al da?

108
00:08:14,577 --> 00:08:17,163
Laurogeita hamabi, 93, 94.

109
00:08:39,519 --> 00:08:41,811
Zer? Agurea ez dago hemen.

110
00:08:41,812 --> 00:08:42,813
Ihes egin du!

111
00:08:43,439 --> 00:08:44,732
Orduan...

112
00:08:45,483 --> 00:08:47,108
Ziur itzuliko dela.

113
00:08:47,109 --> 00:08:49,194
Orduan, borrokatu egingo gara.

114
00:08:49,195 --> 00:08:50,862
Akane, lagunduko dizut.

115
00:08:50,863 --> 00:08:53,573
- Nik ere bai.
- 98, 99, 100.

116
00:08:53,574 --> 00:08:56,826
Nesken aldagelaren azpian dago.

117
00:08:56,827 --> 00:08:58,704
Hor dago gizon itoaren putzua?

118
00:08:59,205 --> 00:09:00,956
Bai, zalantzarik gabe.

119
00:09:00,957 --> 00:09:03,501
<i>Kaka. Bost axola oztopoak...</i>

120
00:09:04,710 --> 00:09:07,295
Orain ez dut atzera egingo.

121
00:09:07,296 --> 00:09:08,839
Elkar lan egin behar dugu.

122
00:09:11,259 --> 00:09:13,134
Neskak, prest zaudete, ez?

123
00:09:13,135 --> 00:09:16,346
Nesken aldagela defenditu
eta babestuko dugu.

124
00:09:16,347 --> 00:09:17,557
- Bai!
- Bai!

125
00:09:18,140 --> 00:09:20,809
- Bat, bi.
<i>- Bat, bi.</i>

126
00:09:20,810 --> 00:09:25,355
- Bat, bi.
- Maisu. Gaur ez zara institutura joango?

127
00:09:25,356 --> 00:09:27,358
- Bai, geroxeago.
<i>- Bat, bi.</i>

128
00:09:29,068 --> 00:09:30,527
Dena prest dago.

129
00:09:30,528 --> 00:09:33,071
Ez dago beste aukerarik:
neskaz jantzi behar dut.

130
00:09:33,072 --> 00:09:37,701
Ranma, atetik sartuko zara ala?

131
00:09:37,702 --> 00:09:39,035
Noski.

132
00:09:39,036 --> 00:09:42,581
Barkaezina!
Akane hor barruan aldatzen ari da.

133
00:09:42,582 --> 00:09:46,751
Aizu, ez ahaztu zertarako gauden hemen.

134
00:09:46,752 --> 00:09:50,131
Gizon itoaren putzua
nesken aldagelaren azpian dago.

135
00:09:53,134 --> 00:09:56,094
Aitona hori etorriko dela uste duzu?

136
00:09:56,095 --> 00:09:57,388
Etorriko da.

137
00:09:58,014 --> 00:10:01,475
Gaur da eguna: txiki-txiki egingo dugu.

138
00:10:02,143 --> 00:10:04,269
Bestela, ezingo dugu sekula lasai aldatu.

139
00:10:04,270 --> 00:10:07,940
- Kaka, zerbait ahaztu zait.
- Egia.

140
00:10:10,735 --> 00:10:14,739
Neska, ez al genuen adostu
sartu aurretik pasahitza esatea?

141
00:10:15,573 --> 00:10:18,658
Barkatu. Ahaztu egin zait.

142
00:10:18,659 --> 00:10:22,120
Ongi, putzua.
Non dago gizon itoaren putzua?

143
00:10:22,121 --> 00:10:24,582
Ranma, zer zabiltza?

144
00:10:25,499 --> 00:10:28,210
Norabide honetan da. Eta distantzia...

145
00:10:29,462 --> 00:10:32,173
- Hemen nonbait egon behar du.
- Zer ari zara?

146
00:10:33,382 --> 00:10:36,134
- Lotsagabea!
- Ez!

147
00:10:36,135 --> 00:10:39,095
- Akane! Lasaitu.
- Tira, tira.

148
00:10:39,096 --> 00:10:40,305
Ondo zaude?

149
00:10:40,306 --> 00:10:42,599
Gaiztoa zara gero, Akane.

150
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:44,684
Aizu!

151
00:10:44,685 --> 00:10:49,314
<i>Ez dira ohartu ni naizela.
Mozorrotzea ideia ona izan da.</i>

152
00:10:49,315 --> 00:10:51,066
Alde oraintxe bertan.

153
00:10:51,067 --> 00:10:53,986
Zer ba? Neska bat naiz nesken aldagelan.

154
00:10:55,321 --> 00:10:57,948
Ez baduzu denen aurrean transformatu nahi...

155
00:10:59,784 --> 00:11:01,785
ospa hemendik!

156
00:11:01,786 --> 00:11:03,745
Neska basatia zara!

157
00:11:03,746 --> 00:11:05,915
Eta? Voyeur zikina!

158
00:11:09,919 --> 00:11:13,756
Ez naiz inozoa, ez diot
horrelako amu bati kosk egingo.

159
00:11:16,092 --> 00:11:19,095
Ranma da, alboko gelakoa.

160
00:11:19,637 --> 00:11:22,264
- Ene, kuleroak daramatza.
- E? Utzi ikusten.

161
00:11:24,725 --> 00:11:26,519
Kaka zaharra!

162
00:11:28,896 --> 00:11:30,355
Nola erein, hala bildu.

163
00:11:30,356 --> 00:11:34,777
Zer ari zara hor lasai eserita?

164
00:11:37,321 --> 00:11:41,659
Akabo. Egin beharrekoa egingo dut
mutil itxura betiko mantentzeko.

165
00:11:42,410 --> 00:11:43,744
Entzun, Ryôga.

166
00:11:44,620 --> 00:11:46,997
Lapurtu arropa eta korrika atera.

167
00:11:47,665 --> 00:11:50,166
Neskak zure atzetik dabiltzan bitartean,

168
00:11:50,167 --> 00:11:52,585
nik gizon itoaren putzua aurkituko dut.

169
00:11:52,586 --> 00:11:53,629
Ulertuta?

170
00:11:54,630 --> 00:11:56,340
Utzi kexatzeari eta egizu.

171
00:11:59,593 --> 00:12:01,136
Hori ez al da P-Chan?

172
00:12:01,137 --> 00:12:03,222
- Zein moñoñoa.
- P-Chan?

173
00:12:07,268 --> 00:12:09,645
Non zinen, P-Chan?

174
00:12:20,281 --> 00:12:22,908
- Odola dario sudurretik.
- P-Chan?

175
00:12:33,711 --> 00:12:35,838
Astakirtena. Esnatu!

176
00:12:40,217 --> 00:12:42,052
Barkatu horrela sartzea.

177
00:12:48,267 --> 00:12:50,644
Bizitza zoragarria da.

178
00:12:51,270 --> 00:12:54,189
Txerria izateak ere baditu bere alde onak.

179
00:12:54,190 --> 00:12:56,900
Ez esan txorakeriarik!

180
00:12:56,901 --> 00:13:00,112
Zer da garrantzitsuagoa?
Berehalako estasia ala putzua?

181
00:13:00,696 --> 00:13:02,697
Berehalako estasia.

182
00:13:02,698 --> 00:13:05,576
<i>Ranma horrek azkar ihes egiten du beti.</i>

183
00:13:07,036 --> 00:13:09,288
Ryôga, joana zinela uste nuen.

184
00:13:10,581 --> 00:13:14,084
Akane. Eskerrik asko lehengoagatik.

185
00:13:16,170 --> 00:13:18,922
Zer? Ranma neskak espiatzen ari zela?

186
00:13:18,923 --> 00:13:22,634
Bai! Ez nuen uste
halakorik egiteko gai zenik.

187
00:13:22,635 --> 00:13:24,220
Utzi niri.

188
00:13:24,720 --> 00:13:27,430
Gizon gisa, ezin dut
halakorik pasatzen utzi.

189
00:13:27,431 --> 00:13:31,476
Eskerrik asko.
Lasaitzen nau zu hemen izateak.

190
00:13:31,477 --> 00:13:35,188
Zure zerbitzura, Akane,
lagungarria naizen bitartean.

191
00:13:35,189 --> 00:13:36,357
Eskerrik asko.

192
00:13:37,274 --> 00:13:39,151
<i>Amore emango dudala uste badu...</i>

193
00:13:39,652 --> 00:13:40,653
<i>Lortu dut.</i>

194
00:13:41,654 --> 00:13:43,280
Ez dago inor.

195
00:13:49,286 --> 00:13:51,038
Zer arraio da hau?

196
00:13:53,707 --> 00:13:56,460
Harrapatu zaitut, kulero lapurra.

197
00:13:57,002 --> 00:13:59,295
Ryôga, artaburua.

198
00:13:59,296 --> 00:14:01,673
Eta gizon itoaren putzua?

199
00:14:01,674 --> 00:14:03,383
Hau Akanerengatik!

200
00:14:03,384 --> 00:14:06,386
Txikituko zaitut, emakumeen etsaia!

201
00:14:06,387 --> 00:14:08,180
Traidorea!

202
00:14:13,644 --> 00:14:16,312
- Alditxo batez ezingo da mugitu.
- Agurea?

203
00:14:16,313 --> 00:14:19,732
Mendi bat! Altxorrez betetako mendia!

204
00:14:19,733 --> 00:14:21,776
Ea, beranduegi izan baino lehen.

205
00:14:21,777 --> 00:14:25,072
Itxaron. Hau al zen zure plana hasieratik?

206
00:14:27,366 --> 00:14:30,786
Beraz, aitonarekin adostua zenuen hau.

207
00:14:39,378 --> 00:14:43,715
Entzun. Elkar lan egingo dugu
altxorrak geureganatzeko.

208
00:14:43,716 --> 00:14:46,176
Aizu, ni ez sartu honetan!

209
00:14:49,263 --> 00:14:52,516
Ranma, zatoz ba.

210
00:14:53,976 --> 00:14:56,060
Presta zaitez, Akane.

211
00:14:56,061 --> 00:14:58,563
Ahal dudan guztia egingo dut

212
00:14:58,564 --> 00:15:01,482
nesken aldagelan sartzeko!

213
00:15:01,483 --> 00:15:05,236
Bravo, Ranma!
Horraino joatea kulero batzuengatik...

214
00:15:05,237 --> 00:15:07,196
Gizon itoaren putzuarengatik!

215
00:15:07,197 --> 00:15:09,157
Bueno.

216
00:15:09,158 --> 00:15:11,493
Emakumeekin liskartzeak eskatzen du...

217
00:15:12,036 --> 00:15:13,912
Ederki, nazkagarria zara.

218
00:15:13,913 --> 00:15:14,955
Kroak.

219
00:15:16,290 --> 00:15:17,875
Metodo hau garaiezina da!

220
00:15:20,419 --> 00:15:23,671
Lasai, neskak. Plastikozkoak dira.

221
00:15:23,672 --> 00:15:27,300
Ez! Sugeak eta igelak dira!

222
00:15:27,301 --> 00:15:30,094
Benetakoak dira!

223
00:15:30,095 --> 00:15:31,388
Ranma!

224
00:15:33,307 --> 00:15:34,350
Kroak.

225
00:15:36,435 --> 00:15:37,895
Kroak, kroak.

226
00:15:40,397 --> 00:15:41,565
Ranma.

227
00:15:48,447 --> 00:15:49,657
Lapurra!

228
00:15:58,040 --> 00:16:00,875
<i>Kaka. Mozorroa dela konturatu da?</i>

229
00:16:00,876 --> 00:16:03,503
<i>Perfektua zela uste nuen.</i>

230
00:16:03,504 --> 00:16:05,004
Ai ama, barkatu!

231
00:16:05,005 --> 00:16:06,799
Ranma zinela uste nuen.

232
00:16:07,716 --> 00:16:10,009
Gaiztoa zara gero.

233
00:16:10,010 --> 00:16:12,262
Nik ez dut ezer egin.

234
00:16:13,222 --> 00:16:14,555
Barkatu!

235
00:16:14,556 --> 00:16:16,100
Mesedez!

236
00:16:17,601 --> 00:16:18,602
Baina...

237
00:16:23,107 --> 00:16:24,315
gogoko zaitut.

238
00:16:24,316 --> 00:16:26,150
Zer? Itxaron.

239
00:16:26,151 --> 00:16:28,528
Oraintxe ezagutu dugu elkar eta...

240
00:16:28,529 --> 00:16:31,447
Betaurrekodun neskak gorroto dituzu?

241
00:16:31,448 --> 00:16:33,658
Ez, baina...

242
00:16:33,659 --> 00:16:35,660
Neska batez maiteminduta nago.

243
00:16:35,661 --> 00:16:37,203
Berdin zait.

244
00:16:37,204 --> 00:16:38,496
Baina...

245
00:16:38,497 --> 00:16:39,665
Serio?

246
00:16:40,958 --> 00:16:42,375
Zeureak egin du!

247
00:16:42,376 --> 00:16:44,877
Zertan ari zara?

248
00:16:44,878 --> 00:16:48,214
Akane, gaizki-ulertu bat da.

249
00:16:48,215 --> 00:16:49,841
Ez dut ezer egin!

250
00:16:49,842 --> 00:16:52,760
{\an8}Akane! Zergatik sartzen zara beti
nire kontuetan?

251
00:16:52,761 --> 00:16:57,306
Ranma. Kulero batzuengatik
hain lotsagarri jokatzeko gai zara?

252
00:16:57,307 --> 00:17:00,685
{\an8}Baboa! Niri bost kuleroak
eta bularretakoak.

253
00:17:00,686 --> 00:17:01,937
{\an8}Nahi dituzu, ezta?

254
00:17:02,730 --> 00:17:04,523
Emango dizkizut ba.

255
00:17:05,566 --> 00:17:09,277
Tranpan erabili genituenak dira.

256
00:17:09,278 --> 00:17:10,737
Entzun...

257
00:17:10,738 --> 00:17:13,741
Baina, mesedez,

258
00:17:14,450 --> 00:17:16,452
utzi arauak hausteari.

259
00:17:17,202 --> 00:17:20,372
Benetan uste nuen zu ez zinela horrelakoa.

260
00:17:20,956 --> 00:17:22,040
Agur!

261
00:17:22,041 --> 00:17:26,378
Itxaron! Hona etorri naiz
gizon itoaren putzua aurkitzeko.

262
00:17:27,671 --> 00:17:29,048
Gizon itoaren putzua?

263
00:17:30,090 --> 00:17:33,510
Nesken aldagelaren azpian?

264
00:17:34,261 --> 00:17:36,345
Hori al da arrazoia, Ranma?

265
00:17:36,346 --> 00:17:38,514
Gezurti baten begiak al dira hauek?

266
00:17:38,515 --> 00:17:41,852
Gezur sinesgarriak asmatu behintzat.

267
00:17:42,561 --> 00:17:46,065
Mozorro bikaina, Ranma.

268
00:17:47,441 --> 00:17:48,608
Bai.

269
00:17:48,609 --> 00:17:52,029
Sekula ez naiz neska batekin irten.

270
00:17:53,822 --> 00:17:56,824
Zer esanik ez maitasun aitorpenik jaso.

271
00:17:56,825 --> 00:18:00,620
Ezta behin ere ez.

272
00:18:00,621 --> 00:18:02,288
Entzun duzu hori?

273
00:18:02,289 --> 00:18:03,540
Gizajoa.

274
00:18:05,250 --> 00:18:06,502
Eta zer gertatzen da?

275
00:18:07,628 --> 00:18:10,546
Izan zintzoa eta esan egia, Ranma.

276
00:18:10,547 --> 00:18:14,175
Zergatik egin duzu hori?

277
00:18:14,176 --> 00:18:17,303
Gizon itoaren putzuarengatik, noski.

278
00:18:17,304 --> 00:18:19,139
Esan nahi duzu...

279
00:18:21,475 --> 00:18:23,684
horregatik zikindu duzula

280
00:18:23,685 --> 00:18:27,897
gizon baten inozentzia?

281
00:18:27,898 --> 00:18:29,398
Ixo.

282
00:18:29,399 --> 00:18:34,488
Zuk erakutsi zenidan eta
gizon itoaren putzuaren mapa!

283
00:18:38,492 --> 00:18:41,078
Ryôga, egia al da hori?

284
00:18:41,578 --> 00:18:44,832
Zertarako nahi duzu
gizon itoaren putzura iristeko mapa?

285
00:18:48,502 --> 00:18:50,921
Ryôga, ez esan...

286
00:19:09,064 --> 00:19:10,816
<i>Nire sekretua deskubritu du.</i>

287
00:19:11,483 --> 00:19:13,819
Ranmari madarikazio kendu nahi zenion.

288
00:19:14,653 --> 00:19:16,405
Zein mutil jatorra zaren.

289
00:19:17,322 --> 00:19:20,325
Eskerrak
Akane ez dela oso azkarra, e, P-Chan?

290
00:19:26,248 --> 00:19:27,291
Nori...

291
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:30,627
deitu diozu P-Chan?

292
00:19:32,671 --> 00:19:34,463
Puntu...

293
00:19:34,464 --> 00:19:37,008
Okerreko helburua aukeratu duzu.

294
00:19:37,009 --> 00:19:39,887
...suntsitzailea!

295
00:19:55,694 --> 00:19:58,113
Ezin liteke...

296
00:20:03,577 --> 00:20:05,162
Lortu dugu.

297
00:20:16,757 --> 00:20:18,133
<i>Gizon itoaren putzua.</i>

298
00:20:19,051 --> 00:20:20,844
<i>Orduan egia zen.</i>

299
00:20:22,512 --> 00:20:23,639
Ei.

300
00:20:24,640 --> 00:20:28,685
Gizon itoaren putzuaren mapa
benetakoa zen, ez?

301
00:20:30,270 --> 00:20:32,980
Orduan, zergatik ez naiz mutil bihurtu!

302
00:20:32,981 --> 00:20:35,150
Esan zerbait, txerria!

303
00:20:43,075 --> 00:20:45,534
<i>Japoniako gizon itoaren putzua,</i>

304
00:20:45,535 --> 00:20:48,955
<i>aspaldidanik ezaguna, itxi egin da.</i>

305
00:20:48,956 --> 00:20:54,127
<i>Mesedez, behar izanez gero, bisitatu
Jusenkyoko gizon itoaren putzua, Txinan.</i>

306
00:20:55,337 --> 00:20:58,298
Orduan, terma arrunt bat zen?

307
00:20:58,882 --> 00:21:02,760
E! Nor izan da? Nork apurtu du ur-hodia?

308
00:21:02,761 --> 00:21:04,263
Ranma.

309
00:21:08,600 --> 00:21:10,851
Nondik atera duzu azpiko arropa hau?

310
00:21:10,852 --> 00:21:12,187
Aurkitu egin dut.

311
00:21:15,482 --> 00:21:19,068
Zer duzu, P-Chan? Geldo zabiltza.

312
00:21:19,069 --> 00:21:23,115
Azkenean itxura honekin
zoriontsuagoa izango zara.

313
00:22:57,042 --> 00:23:02,047
{\an8}Azpitituluak: Loinaz C. A.

